    ['Legal pages added','Terms, Privacy and Community Rules pages are now in the app as launch placeholders.','warn'],
    ['Public release mode','Keep demo payments disabled until PayPal live keys, webhook verification and backend database are connected.','danger'],
    ['Profile safety','Verification, report profile, report post and admin moderation flows are present for the production build.','good'],
    ['Mobile readiness','Manifest, service worker, icons and install button are included from Phase 10.','good']
